WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.460
EasyNotes: your notes, organised into topics - three levels deep.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:17.490
Open a page. Everything is saved as you type - there is no Save button.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:28.260
Zoom any page, sheet or checklist: the slider under the header, or Ctrl + mouse wheel.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:44.580
Recent Work keeps the twenty pages you touched last within reach.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:56.740
Above the tree: New topic, Import, text size, and Collapse all.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:10.900
Search looks through topic names, page titles and page contents as you type.

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:25.990
A new page: the + on a topic (or Ctrl+N). Page, Spreadsheet, Checklist - or import a document.

00:01:25.990 --> 00:02:14.400
Markdown shortcuts work: "# " for a heading, "- " for a list, "1. " for numbering.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.033
Saved. Your notes live in a folder you choose - no registration, no subscription, works offline.

